# =============================================================================
# Docker build context excludes - MTA-STS Server
# =============================================================================
# Build context: ./src
#
# Docker uses Go's filepath.Match plus `**/` for recursion. Patterns WITHOUT
# `**/` only match at the context root — so to ignore `__pycache__/` at any
# depth we MUST write `**/__pycache__` (unlike .gitignore, which matches at
# every depth automatically).
#
# NOTE: tests/, pytest.ini and requirements-test.txt are intentionally NOT
# excluded — the Dockerfile "test" stage needs them as a build gate.
# =============================================================================

# Python bytecode + caches (recursive — `**/` is required)
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov
**/.tox

# Virtualenvs (in case anyone runs `python -m venv` inside the source tree)
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# Editor / OS noise
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Local-only files that have no business in the build
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
